735	    /** Move a DRAFT, OPEN or PENDING claim to another person on the sheet. It keeps its date and takes the next
736	     *  number in the sequence it is numbered in (its old number is never used again; a DRAFT has none),
737	     *  loses any figure a statement bound it to (live again until its new person's next statement), and is
738	     *  listed as its new person's newest claim. Refused unless the user's role may reassign, and for a settled or
739	     *  voided claim, a claim in a closed period, the claim's own person, or a person retired on its date. */
